description=Run Linux containers on Android via a privileged daemon that bypasses the app seccomp filter. Docker Hub pull, private-namespace mounts (host audio stays intact), PTY shells, mini-systemd init + systemctl shim, --shared-display (termux-x11) + --shared-audio, setuser least privilege, convert --move (zero extra space), optional box64. Full docs wiki + SECURITY.md.
